{"surah":90,"ayahs":["<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>سِمُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span> حِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">لُّۢ بِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","وَوَالِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ وَ</span>مَا وَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دَ</span>","لَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> خَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>نَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نَ فِى كَبَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٍ</span>","أَيَحْسَبُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">أَن لَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ن يَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>دِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَال<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">اً لُّ</span>بَدًا","أَيَحْسَبُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">أَن لَّ</span>مْ يَرَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أَحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","أَلَمْ نَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>عَل لَّهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَيْنَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">يْ</span>نِ","وَلِسَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا وَ</span>شَفَتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">يْ</span>نِ","وَهَدَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>دَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">يْ</span>نِ","فَلَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>تَحَمَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَقَبَةَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَقَبَةُ","فَكُّ رَقَبَةٍ","أَوْ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مٌ فِ</span>ى يَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مٍ ذِ</span>ى مَسْغَبَةٍ","يَتِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مًا ذَ</span>ا مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>رَبَةٍ","أَوْ مِسْكِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نًا ذَ</span>ا مَتْرَبَةٍ","ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> كَانَ مِنَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَتَوَاصَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رِ وَتَوَاصَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَرْحَمَةِ","أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">وْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَٰٓ</span>ئِكَ أَصْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>بُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَيْمَنَةِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِـَٔـا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>تِنَا هُمْ أَصْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>بُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَشْــَٔمَةِ","عَلَيْهِمْ نَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ مُّ</span>ؤْصَدَةُۢ"]}